<p>Its pretty neat, to be Honest.<br />
I have a softspot for Plantbased SCPs and these ones are pretty interessting. I like the Story told honestly. And the little Notes of Allegre are pretty nice. I dont know, I like Notes from the Researchers.</p>
<p>I think, that the Senctences could flow a little bit better, but that could be just me. And you should really put &quot;the&quot; before &quot;Entities&quot; sometimes. Maybe even look for a Synonym, to avoid using &quot;Entities&quot; so much.</p>
<p>And it would maybe be nice, if you would write the &quot;Common&quot; Species-Name on top of its latin Name, so that one have an Idea what they are, without needing to google it. But again, that could only be an issue of mine.<br />
(Or a Pic of them, but I dont know if one can find a Pic that fits the Criteria and has no Copyright attached)</p>
<p>But at the end, its really nice. So have my +1 :3</p>

